  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiji tshia Yehowa tshiakatemena Bena Isalele kabidi, wakenzesha Davidi bualu buabo, wamba ne, Ya, bala bungi bua Bena Isalele ne bua Bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakambila Yoaba, kapitene ka masalayi andi, wakadi nʼandi ne, Wendakane munkatshi mua bisamba bionso bia Bena Isalele, ku Dana tô ne ku Bê-sheba, ubale bantu, bua meme kumanya bungi buabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoaba wakambila mukelenge ne, Yehowa, Nzambi webe, akumbashe bantu bu mudiye musue, nansha misangu lukama lukama, mesu a mukelenge wanyi atangile bualu ebu; kadi mukelenge wanyi udi ukeba disanka ku bualu ebu bua tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi dî dia mukelenge diakahita mei a Yoaba ne tupitene tua masalayi bukole. Yoaba ne tupitene tua masalayi bakumuka ku mesu kua mukelenge bua kubalabo bungi bua Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakasabuka Yadene, bakasa tshitudilu tshiabo ku Aloê, ku luseke lua tshianza tshia balume tshia musoko tshiakadi munkatshi mua tshibanda tshia Gada mu nshila wa ku Yasê. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bakafika ku Gilada mu buloba bua Tatima-hodeshi; bakafika ku Dana-yana, bakahitshila mu buloba bua Sidona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakafika ku musoko wa lumbu wa Tulo, ne ku misoko yonso ya Bena Hiwi ne ya Bena Kanâna; bakanyunguluka ku luseke lua Sude lua Yuda tô ne ku Bê-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku hakendakanabo ku buloba buonso, bakalua ku Yelushalema hakahita ngondo tshitema ne matuku makumi abidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoaba wakamanyisha mukelenge bungi bua bantu: bena bukitu bakadi batuale miele ya nvita ba mu Bena Isalele bakadi bantu binunu nkama muanda mukulu, ne ba mu Bena Yuda bakadi bantu binunu nkama itanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabala Davidi bantu, mutshima wandi wakamuhisha. Davidi wakambila Yehowa ne, Nakenza bubi mu bualu ebu bunakenza; kadi Yehowa, ndi nkusengelela ne, Ubuikile bubi bua muntu webe, bualu bua nakenza bualu buhote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabika Davidi ne dinda dionso, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudiye kudi muprofete wandi Gada, mumonyi wa malu wa Davidî, ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya, wambile Davidi ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Ndi nteka malu asatu ku mpala kuebe, udisunguile bumue buau bûdi musue meme kukuenzelabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Gada wakafika kudi Davidi, wakamuambila malu au, wakamukonka ne, Udi musue batume bidimu bia tshiole muanda mutekete mu buloba buebe? Anyi udi musue kunyema ku mesu kua badi nʼebe lukuna tô ngondo isatu? Anyi udi musue batume disama dikole mu buloba buebe tô matuku asatu? Ela meji, ungambile tshindi mua kuitaba kudi wakuntuma kûdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakambila Gada ne, Ndi munkatshi mua malu manene: tuhone mu bianza bia Yehowa, bualu bua luse luandi ludi lunene; tshihonyi mu bianza bia bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa wakatumina Bena Isalele disama dikole dinda adi tô ne bakafika tshikondo tshiakasunguleye; bantu bakafua ku Dana tô ne ku Bê-sheba bakadi binunu makumi muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamba muanjelo kuolola tshianza tshiandi ku Yelushalema bua kubutula, Yehowa wakakudimuna dî diandi, wakambila muanjelo wakadi ushiha bantu ne, Bualu abu buakukumbana; katataka kandisha tshianza tshiebe. Muanjelo wa Yehowa wakadi hehi ne tshishihuidi tshia Alauna, Muena Yebuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatangila Davidi muanjelo wakadi ushiha bantu, yeye wakambila Yehowa ne, Mona, nakenza bibi, nakenza bualu buhote; kadi mikoko ei yakenza tshinyi? Ndi nkusengelela ne, Tshianza tshiebe tshikale kundi ne ku tshiota tshia tatu wanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dituku adi Gada wakalua kudi Davidi, wakamuambila ne, Ya, washile Yehowa tshioshelu ku tshishihuidi tshia Alauna, Muena Yebuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakabanda bu mu dî dia Gada diakamba Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alauna wakabanduluka, wakatangila mukelenge ne bantu bandi balue kudiye; Alauna wakaluhuka, wakatua mpala wandi hanshi ku mesu kua mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alauna wakakonka ne, Mukelenge wanyi wakalua kudi muntu wandi bua tshinyi? Davidi wakamba ne, Bua kusumba tshishihuidi tshiebe, ne bua kuashilaku Yehowa tshioshelu, bua disama edi dishike munkatshi mua bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alauna wakambila Davidi ne, Mukelenge wanyi angate bintu bionso bidiye musue, abifile bu mulambu; tangila ngombe ya kuosha ha kahia kayiyi; wangate bintu bidibo bahehula nʼabi ne bikokedi bia ngombe bua nkunyi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alauna neahe mukelenge bintu ebi bionso. Alauna wakambila mukelenge kabidi ne, Yehowa, Nzambi webe, akuitabushe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakambila Alauna ne, Nansha, nengule bintu ebi kûdi ku mushinga; tshiena nfila mulambu wa kuosha ha kahia kudi Yehowa, Nzambi wanyi, milangala hatuhu. Nunku Davidi wakula tshishihuidi ne ngombe ku nshekele",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.24:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nshekele wa argent wakadi ne bujitu bu bua 15 grammes.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya argent makumi atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakashilaku Yehowa tshioshelu, wakafilahu milambu ya kuosha ha kahia ne milambu ya kuvuisha nʼai ditalala. Yehowa wakasengeledibua nunku bua buloba, ne disama diakashika munkatshi mua Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
